## The AssembledToolCall type

Each entry in the `toolCalls` array is an `AssembledToolCall` object:

```ts
interface AssembledToolCall<
  TName extends string = string,
  TInput = unknown,
  TOutput = unknown,
> {
  name: TName;
  callId: string;
  id: string;
  namespace: string[];
  input: TInput;
  args: TInput;
  output: TOutput | null;
  status: "running" | "finished" | "error";
  error: string | undefined;
}
```

